<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 100s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 2nd century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 100s BCE, 399 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 41 were founded and 141 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Roman Republic, the Han Dynasty and the Xiongnu Empire.</p></header>
